					<description><![CDATA[<p>This is a rough estimate of what you will get</p>
<ul>
<li>Tbone Steaks</li>
<li>New York Steaks</li>
<li>Scotch Fillets</li>
<li>Rump Steaks</li>
<li>Blade Steaks</li>
<li>500-600g tray of Beef Stir Fry</li>
<li>500-600g tray of Diced Beef</li>
<li>BBQ Steaks</li>
<li>Blade Steaks (bone in)</li>
<li>Stewing Steaks</li>
<li>Osso Bucco</li>
<li>500g Premium Beef Mince</li>
<li>trays of Beef Sausages (6 per tray)</li>
<li>Rolled Roast</li>
<li>Silverside</li>
<li>Brisket</li>
<li>Trim and Bones</li>
</ul>
